want to enforce the format of each item in the array. This is done by speci=
fying a JSON Schema that each array item must conform to using the <code>it=
ems</code> keyword.</p>
<p>For example, the following schema requires an array of IP addresses.</p>
<pre class=3D"language-php" tabindex=3D"0"><code class=3D"language-php"><sp=
an class=3D"token php language-php"><span class=3D"token keyword">array</sp=
an><span class=3D"token punctuation">(</span>
    <span class=3D"token string single-quoted-string">'type'</span>  <span =
class=3D"token operator">=3D&gt;</span> <span class=3D"token string single-=
quoted-string">'array'</span><span class=3D"token punctuation">,</span>
