        <span class=3D"token string single-quoted-string">'type'</span>   <=
span class=3D"token operator">=3D&gt;</span> <span class=3D"token string si=
ngle-quoted-string">'string'</span><span class=3D"token punctuation">,</spa=
n>
        <span class=3D"token string single-quoted-string">'format'</span> <=
span class=3D"token operator">=3D&gt;</span> <span class=3D"token string si=
ngle-quoted-string">'ip'</span><span class=3D"token punctuation">,</span>
    <span class=3D"token punctuation">)</span><span class=3D"token punctuat=
ion">,</span>
<span class=3D"token punctuation">)</span><span class=3D"token punctuation"=
>;</span>
</span></code></pre>
