<h4 id=3D"required-properties" class=3D"is-toc-heading" tabindex=3D"-1"><a =
href=3D"https://developer.wordpress.org/rest-api/extending-the-rest-api/sch=
ema/#required-properties">Required Properties</a></h4>
<p>By default, any properties listed for an object are optional, so while i=
