<pre class=3D"language-json" tabindex=3D"0"><code class=3D"language-json"><=
span class=3D"token punctuation">{</span>
  <span class=3D"token property">"name"</span><span class=3D"token operator=
">:</span> <span class=3D"token string">"Primary"</span>
<span class=3D"token punctuation">}</span>
</code></pre>
<p>There are two mechanisms for requiring a property to be provided.</p>
<h5 id=3D"version-3-syntax" class=3D"is-toc-heading" tabindex=3D"-1"><a hre=
