<p>The REST API will loop over each schema specified in the <code>oneOf</co=
de> array and look for a match. If exactly one schema matches, then validat=
ion will succeed. If more than one schema matches, validation will fail. If=
 no schemas match, then the validator will try to find the closest matching=
 schema and return an appropriate error message.</p>
<blockquote><p>
  operations[0] is not a valid Rotation. Reason: operations[0][degrees] mus=
t be between 0 (inclusive) and 360 (inclusive)
</p></blockquote>
<p>To generate more helpful error messages, it is highly recommended to giv=
e each <code>oneOf</code> or <code>anyOf</code> schema a <code>title</code>=
 property.</p>
